tomers, security patches applied inconsistently, and database configurations that don't match app versions. Complete audit needed.\\n[2024-12-12 14:00:00] @bob (M0040): Audit results: our deployment system has been cross-contaminating versions for weeks. HSBC's v2.4.0 somehow got v2.4.2 database configs, Goldman's v2.4.1 has partial v2.3.9 components. It's complete chaos.\"}"}}
